# CampusEats → Multi-Agent AI Workspace Brief (Project Brief)

> This assignment is aligned to the actual Multi-Agent AI Workspace project, not a food-ordering system.

## What
Multi-Agent AI Workspace is an AI-powered workspace where a user submits a complex task and multiple specialized AI agents collaborate to solve it. An Orchestrator/Planner decomposes the task, selects agents, coordinates execution, shares context, and sends outputs through testing and review before the final result is delivered.

## Who
- End users who submit and monitor tasks
- Workspace members who collaborate on tasks
- Administrators/authorized users who manage access
- Specialized AI agents that perform subtasks
- Testing and Review agents that validate generated work

